A marker that misses a description folds into its item

```
:: t
: - a
- b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ul>
      <li>a</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
<ul>
  <li>b</li>
</ul>
```

```
:: t
: 1. a
2. b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ol>
      <li>a</li>
    </ol>
  </dd>
</dl>
<ol start="2">
  <li>b</li>
</ol>
```

```
:: t
: - a

- b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ul>
      <li>a</li>
    </ul>
  </dd>
</dl>
<ul>
  <li>b</li>
</ul>
```
